1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,350
Some contract questions aren't a RAG problem at
all, no matter how well you chunk.

2
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:10,900
Take "all contracts with auto-renewal
and under 30 days' notice".

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,975
Retrieval returns the top few chunks.

4
00:00:14,275 --> 00:00:16,625
This question needs every match.

5
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:22,711
So extract clauses into a structured table
when contracts come in, and answer it

6
00:00:22,711 --> 00:00:23,325
with SQL.

7
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:29,150
RAG then handles only the long tail, the
questions your schema doesn't cover.

8
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:32,775
The full article is on vidyal.ai.
